---
import PlatformCards from "./PlatformCards.astro";
---

<section class="install wrap" id="install">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <h2>Install</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Sajilo isn't a normal window. It lives next to your clock: click it to open, click away and it
      tucks back. It starts with your computer, so it's there whenever you look. Beta builds aren't
      code-signed yet, so each system shows a warning the first time you open it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <PlatformCards />
</section>

<style>
  .install {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-top: clamp(80px, 11vw, 160px);
  }
</style>
